Role Summary

PLOS is a nonprofit Open Access publisher with an ambitious mission: to help transform research communication so that science can be shared, understood and used more effectively.&nbsp;

Research publishing is changing rapidly. Researchers' expectations are changing. Technology is creating possibilities that&nbsp;didn't&nbsp;exist a few years ago. And at PLOS&nbsp;we're&nbsp;rethinking some of the services, systems and assumptions that have shaped scholarly publishing for decades. &nbsp;

That means there are interesting product&nbsp; problems &nbsp;to solve - not just features to deliver. &nbsp;

You'll&nbsp;take responsibility for a product area and work with designers,&nbsp;engineers&nbsp;and colleagues across PLOS to understand the problems that matter, work out where we can make the greatest difference and help the team learn its way towards good solutions. &nbsp;

